  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source HMIS platform for public health — deployed in 80+ countries, endorsed by WHO, World Bank, Gates Foundation, Gavi, UNICEF, and Wellcome Trust, and recognised as a Digital Public Good. 14,826 commits, FHIR-integrated, BSD 3-Clause. Led by the HISP Centre at the University of Oslo with a global network of implementers. Fills the public health surveillance slot in the MACH catalog that OpenMRS (clinical EMR) and OpenEMR (practice management) do not cover.",
